<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>스크롤 on 얼쑤 · Team Edo</title><link>https://team-edo.github.io/tags/%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A1%A4/</link><description>Recent content in 스크롤 on 얼쑤 · Team Edo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-kr</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://team-edo.github.io/tags/%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A1%A4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>조금 밀었을 뿐인데 홈 화면이 중간으로 순간이동했다</title><link>https://team-edo.github.io/posts/2026/11/compose-fling-snap-and-first-composition/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://team-edo.github.io/posts/2026/11/compose-fling-snap-and-first-composition/</guid><description>&lt;p>얼쑤의 홈 첫 화면은 일반적인 목록이 아닙니다. 위로 400dp를 미는 동안 그림이 작아지고 제목과 시작 버튼이 올라가며, 다 펼치면 그 아래에 기능 카드가 나타납니다. 이 400dp 구간을 코드에서는 무대라고 부릅니다. 무대 중간에 멈춰 있지 않도록 손을 떼면 닫힌 쪽(0dp)이나 펼친 쪽(400dp)으로 맞춰 주는 스냅이 있습니다.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-kotlin" data-lang="kotlin">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">internal&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">fun&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">homeSnapTarget&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">scroll&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Float&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">wasOpen&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Boolean&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Float&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">when&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">scroll&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">HomeScrollRange&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">scroll&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">scroll&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="m">0f&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="m">0f&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">scroll&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">HomeScrollRange&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">wasOpen&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">85f&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">else&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">12f&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">HomeScrollRange&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">else&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="m">0f&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>닫힌 상태에서는 12%(48dp)만 넘겨도 펼치고, 펼친 상태에서는 85% 아래로 내려와야 닫힙니다. 문제는 첫 화면에서 살짝 밀었을 때였습니다. 화면이 손가락을 따라오다가 중간 과정을 건너뛰고 무대 중간으로 순간이동한 뒤, 다시 끝까지 움직였습니다. 목표는 손가락의 움직임에서 스냅까지 하나로 이어지게 만드는 것이었습니다.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>